<%= render layout: 'blogs/blog_post_layout', locals: { article: article } do %>
  <p class="lead">Your AI agent just emailed your entire customer database to an attacker. Here's how it happens and how to stop it.</p>

  <h2>What Is Prompt Injection?</h2>
  <p>Prompt injection is tricking an LLM with carefully crafted inputs so it follows attacker instructions instead of your system prompt. Because LLMs can't reliably distinguish "instructions" from "data," user input can override your rules.</p>

  <h2>Real Examples of Attacks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Email summarizer leaking credentials from messages.</li>
    <li>Customer support agent convinced to run SQL from user input.</li>
    <li>Document analyzer exfiltrating sensitive content in its summary.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Types of Attacks</h2>
  <p><strong>Direct injection</strong>, malicious user input. <strong>Indirect injection</strong>, poisoned documents the model reads. <strong>Jailbreaking</strong>, bypassing safety. <strong>Goal hijacking</strong>, changing the task the model performs. All rely on the model treating attacker text as authoritative.</p>

  <h2>Defense Strategies</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Input validation</strong>, detect suspicious patterns (e.g. "ignore previous instructions").</li>
    <li><strong>Prompt sandboxing</strong>, keep system prompt and user content clearly separated; don't mix in one blob.</li>
    <li><strong>Output filtering</strong>, check for credentials, SQL, PII before returning to user.</li>
    <li><strong>Privilege separation</strong>, agents can't access everything; scope permissions.</li>
    <li><strong>Human in the loop</strong>, critical actions require approval.</li>
    <li><strong>Rate limiting</strong>, per user to slow down probing.</li>
    <li><strong>Monitoring</strong>, anomaly detection on inputs and outputs.</li>
  </ol>

  <p>Real incident: a healthcare AI leaked PHI via indirect injection from a poisoned document. Red team your own AI before someone else does. <a href="https://calendly.com/ahmadkamran/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Schedule an AI security audit</a>.</p>
<% end %>
